/// Interface to mark anything that can surround objects so they move with it.
/// Things that can be contained should use PointsQuery to search these out
/// and reparent to the one they think is best.
/// e.g. sample the field against several key points and pick the one that
/// is negative (meaning the containable is inside it) and the distance
/// closest to zero (meaning you can have containers inside containers
/// and parent to the one that wraps the object the closest).
/// Security is maintained by the inability to see the relative position of
/// any containable object directly or have direct influence over it.
interface Container {}
